# debug/

Rust compiler debug build artifacts including dependency tracking files, compiled libraries (rlib), and intermediate object files from the build process for the udex project workspace.

## Files

- `.cargo-lock` -- Cargo lock file for build dependency resolution
- `libudex_api.d` -- Dependency tracking for udex_api crate
- `libudex_api.rlib` -- Compiled Rust library for API definitions and authorization
- `libudex_datastore.d` -- Dependency tracking for udex_datastore crate
- `libudex_datastore.rlib` -- Compiled Rust library for database operations
- `libudex_server.d` -- Dependency tracking for udex_server crate
- `libudex_server.rlib` -- Compiled Rust library for gRPC server implementation

## Object Files

- `udex_datastore-*.rcgu.o/` -- 50+ compiler code generation units for datastore crate
- `udex_server-*.rcgu.o/` -- 70+ compiler code generation units for server crate
